# KEEPERS RED ON PROGRAM ITSELF, OWED: each still runs on every gate, its words kept, and its failure is
# this line's debt rather than the gate's verdict. One a line: the keeper, its owner, why. A keeper here
# that PASSES fails the gate until its line is struck, so the list only shrinks; a line with no owner
# fails too. Measured on program 6e7371be (the static keepers by `make -k keepers-static`; the rest named
# red by the lead).
read-lists lane-spec-harness red on program 6e7371be, latent behind a gate that ran no keeper
inputs lane-spec-harness red on program 6e7371be, latent behind a gate that ran no keeper
externs lane-spec-harness red on program 6e7371be, latent behind a gate that ran no keeper
cutoff-witness lane-spec-harness red on program 6e7371be, latent behind a gate that ran no keeper
vocab lane-targets compiler/interface.av is gone, and the DeclKind consumer registry still names it
cited lane-wisp names CLAUDE.md cites name nothing in the tree
http-cites lane-wisp a fixture docs/2026_09_29_HTTP_CONFORMANCE.md cites is gone
suites lane-wisp .github/ci/suite-splits.txt covers no path of some suites
vendored-fixture lane-wisp std_sources.av is not what the packages say
